@WebAnalyticsAggregator_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register New Account
POST {{WebAnalyticsAggregator_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Portfolio Reviewer",
  "email": "reviewer@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 2. Login User
# @name login
POST {{WebAnalyticsAggregator_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reviewer@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### Store token from response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Get Aggregated Overview Report
GET {{WebAnalyticsAggregator_HostAddress}}/api/reports/overview
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Get Per-Page Performance & Analytics Metrics
GET {{WebAnalyticsAggregator_HostAddress}}/api/reports/pages
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Get Daily Time-Series Stats for a Specific Page
GET {{WebAnalyticsAggregator_HostAddress}}/api/reports/daily?page=https://example.com/home
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
